{
  "description": "Merging every device's file into one view. `files` are the device files as downloaded (`content` is the raw JSON, `deviceId` the <id> of device-<id>.json); `expected` is the merged view, which always has `channels`, `watched` and `settings`. Per key the entry with the greatest `at` wins; on equal `at` the greater deviceId (ASCII order) wins; the winning entry is kept whole, unknown fields included: a watched entry's `position` and `seen` travel with its `watched` and are never merged on their own. `seen` takes no part in the order: `at` alone decides, then the deviceId. A file that is not an object or whose `version` is not the number 1 is skipped; `channels`/`watched`/`settings` that are missing or not objects read as empty; an entry that is not an object, whose `at` is not a whole number from 0 to 2^53-1, whose `filter` is not an object, whose `watched` is not a boolean, or (in `settings`) that has no `value` field, is dropped. A setting's `value` may be any JSON value, `null` included, and is kept as it is under any name: filter field values (a filter's `groups` among them: shared/fixtures/groups.json reads it, and since each channel's entry is its own key, two devices that put different channels in one group both do), a watched entry's `position` (shared/fixtures/watch-progress.json reads it) and `seen` (shared/fixtures/prune.json reads it) and setting values are not checked here (shared/fixtures/settings.json reads the settings).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "no files",
      "files": [],
      "expected": {
        "version": 1,
        "channels": {},
        "watched": {},
        "settings": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "one file reads as itself",
      "files": [
        {
          "deviceId": "a",
          "content": {
            "version": 1,
            "channels": {
              "UC1": {
                "at": 1759500000000,
                "filter": {
                  "enabled": true,
                  "regex": "x",
                  "mode": "include"
                }
              }
            },
            "watched": {
              "v1": {
                "at": 1759500000000,
                "watched": true
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "version": 1,
        "channels": {
          "UC1": {
            "at": 1759500000000,
            "filter": {
              "enabled": true,
              "regex": "x",
              "mode": "include"
            }
          }
